# Python

- Target Python 3.10+. Use `from __future__ import annotations` in GUI modules.
- Domain types are dataclasses in `models.py`. Screen labels come from `WORK_MODE_LABELS` / `CATEGORY_LABELS` / `BUILDER_LABEL` / `TABLE_QA_LABEL` / `CARS_LIST_LABEL`.
- Do not add dependencies unless existing ones cannot do the job. Tests use stdlib `unittest`.
- Do not duplicate car search, preview, or copy-button UI; use widgets in `prompt_builder/gui/widgets.py`.
- Parsers raise `ValueError` with a filename. Clipboard errors stay `ClipboardError`.
